# Real Infrastructure Validation

- Run smoke, integration, and validation checks against the real local infrastructure when it is available.
- Do not replace Ollama or target services with fake/stub servers unless the user explicitly asks for an isolated test double.
- For Ollama checks, prefer portable CLI commands such as `ollama list`, `ollama ps`, `ollama show <model>`, and `ollama run <model> <prompt>`.
- If real infrastructure is unavailable, report that clearly instead of silently substituting mocks.
